...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
fitness: Fitness Expert { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API { class: ext }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
session: 세션 상태 { class: store }
dietary: Dietary Expert { class: ours }

user -> ui: 프로필 입력 + 버튼 클릭
ui -> dietary: dietary_agent.run(user_profile)
dietary -> gemini: role·instructions 시스템 메시지 + user_profile
gemini -> dietary: meal_plan 텍스트
dietary -> ui: RunOutput.content
ui -> fitness: fitness_agent.run(user_profile)
fitness -> gemini: role·instructions 시스템 메시지 + user_profile
gemini -> fitness: routine 텍스트
fitness -> ui: RunOutput.content
ui -> session: dict 조합(meal_plan·routine + 고정 문구) 저장
ui -> user: 두 계획 렌더링(expander)
